Limits:these checks use emulated USB controllers/devices and Windows Wine.
They do not establish physical-flash endurance, hardware compatibility,
VirtualBox behavior, native-Windows device writing, Secure Boot trust, or
runtime USB storage support in the current Zero kernel. The flash utility
runs in the Zero boot environment using firmware services before the OS.
